WEBVTT

00:16.400 --> 00:18.670
Where... am I?

00:37.820 --> 00:38.760
Gouta-kun.

00:39.270 --> 00:40.060
Yo.

00:40.060 --> 00:43.020
Gouta-kun, where have you been this whole time?

00:43.020 --> 00:44.810
Have you been "there" till morning?

00:44.810 --> 00:46.190
What you mean by "there"?

00:46.190 --> 00:49.060
That bar where Seiichiro goes to.

00:52.460 --> 00:53.330
Where is Suzuki?

00:53.900 --> 00:55.050
Sora-chan...

00:55.720 --> 01:00.000
and Seiichiro-kun left early for a request.

01:01.320 --> 01:03.980
I see, so they are together.

01:04.790 --> 01:05.720
What do you mean by that?

01:06.130 --> 01:06.850
Nothing.

01:07.300 --> 01:09.400
Gouta-kun, don't you be late.

01:19.250 --> 01:20.320
Stupid fool!

01:26.170 --> 01:26.870
Yes.

01:27.840 --> 01:29.690
Please contact us when she wakes up.

01:30.250 --> 01:32.690
Yes, Gouta-kun has returned.

01:34.240 --> 01:37.850
Yes, I've prepared some food. I'll bring it over.

01:39.020 --> 01:39.720
Yes.

03:45.400 --> 03:48.740
It seems like the final exam will be water magic again.

03:48.740 --> 03:52.430
To see if our power has improved from using the same magic, right?

03:53.490 --> 03:55.580
Sounds like you already know.

03:56.370 --> 03:57.530
Am I wrong?

03:58.690 --> 04:00.440
You really aren't cute at all.

04:08.490 --> 04:10.630
Sora-chan didn't come with you?

04:12.700 --> 04:14.020
Did she catch a cold again?

04:14.790 --> 04:15.690
Who knows.

04:15.690 --> 04:17.060
I didn't hear anything.

04:17.060 --> 04:18.720
Oh, you've already had an argument?

04:20.810 --> 04:23.950
Midorikawa Gouta is really transparent.

04:23.950 --> 04:25.310
I wonder what happened.

04:25.950 --> 04:28.660
Poor Midorikawa-kun.

04:30.220 --> 04:32.340
I'm worried about Suzuki Sora.

04:32.930 --> 04:34.080
Sora-chan...

04:57.900 --> 04:59.310
Hurry up! Hurry up!

05:01.100 --> 05:02.190
Wait for me.

05:02.190 --> 05:03.080
Hurry up!

05:03.840 --> 05:04.670
Ouch...

05:06.240 --> 05:07.920
Are you all right?

05:08.650 --> 05:09.860
I'm fine.

05:10.300 --> 05:12.240
Hey, don't leave me behind!

05:27.420 --> 05:28.580
Mom.

05:54.080 --> 05:55.150
What is it?

05:55.630 --> 05:56.740
Are you okay?

05:57.430 --> 05:58.180
Yes.

06:00.230 --> 06:03.090
Are you having trouble?

06:04.840 --> 06:05.570
Yeah...

06:07.740 --> 06:09.320
You have worked hard.

06:10.130 --> 06:11.680
You really worked hard.

06:15.610 --> 06:16.850
Mom.

06:16.850 --> 06:17.620
Hmm?

06:18.340 --> 06:19.140
What is it?

06:19.680 --> 06:21.230
I want to go back to Biei.

06:21.910 --> 06:24.360
Yes, you can come back anytime.

06:27.130 --> 06:29.260
Yes, of course.

06:29.710 --> 06:30.650
Of course.

06:35.580 --> 06:39.910
Now that's news: Sora-chan is coming back?

06:39.910 --> 06:41.080
No,

06:41.640 --> 06:43.470
she won't come back yet.

06:44.090 --> 06:45.800
That child is like that.

06:46.590 --> 06:51.900
Honestly, Sora is much stronger than any of us.

06:57.950 --> 07:02.050
Please, will you let me use magic once again?

07:02.820 --> 07:03.660
I...

07:04.460 --> 07:08.740
can't imagine what it is like to not have memories.

07:10.010 --> 07:11.880
Sora-san, was it?

07:12.340 --> 07:13.060
Yes.

07:14.460 --> 07:19.220
After the incident, I thought that it was fine that her life was saved.

07:20.220 --> 07:23.040
But now we can live together.

07:26.370 --> 07:31.170
I'm afraid that we would be punished if we asked for more,

07:32.840 --> 07:36.350
like everything would go back to how it originally was.

07:36.350 --> 07:38.010
I will give it my best!

07:41.200 --> 07:44.860
My wife is playing with Shion in the garden.

07:46.120 --> 07:47.980
Although she doesn't go out into the city yet,

07:48.490 --> 07:52.290
she is now making new memories with both Shion and I.

07:54.510 --> 07:56.460
New memories...

07:58.480 --> 08:01.450
Every day, we can discover new things,

08:01.450 --> 08:04.090
and so we can look forward to another tomorrow.

08:04.810 --> 08:07.060
I'm really grateful to you.

08:07.520 --> 08:10.620
That is why there is no need for magic anymore.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.970
Mama, over here.

08:12.970 --> 08:13.910
All right.

08:13.440 --> 08:14.680
Over here.

08:14.680 --> 08:16.480
Wait a moment.

08:16.930 --> 08:18.690
Come quickly.

08:20.110 --> 08:22.950
We got to watch the sea at Kogane Cape.

08:23.490 --> 08:25.700
The sea? That sounds great.

08:26.730 --> 08:27.770
Ah, Papa!

08:27.770 --> 08:29.360
Shall we all go together next time?

08:29.360 --> 08:30.480
Me too?

08:30.480 --> 08:32.740
We won't go without Mama!

08:32.740 --> 08:34.570
My, my.

08:34.570 --> 08:37.050
Hey, what should we do at the sea?

08:37.960 --> 08:39.030
How about fishing?

08:39.030 --> 08:40.080
Oh, fishing!

08:40.080 --> 08:41.330
That's great!

08:42.130 --> 08:43.830
Mama will fish a lot too.

08:43.830 --> 08:46.080
Looking forward to another tomorrow...

08:46.080 --> 08:47.920
Will you teach me, then?

08:47.920 --> 08:49.590
Sure, I'll teach you!

08:49.590 --> 08:51.390
I won't lose to Mama.

09:23.050 --> 09:24.330
I'm home.

09:30.680 --> 09:34.060
Wouldn't it be better if we filed a missing person report?

09:39.120 --> 09:40.340
You have a point.

09:40.340 --> 09:42.790
If anything happens right now, Sora-chan would...

09:45.820 --> 09:49.020
You've all been discussing something in a low voice since this morning. What are you hiding?

09:49.020 --> 09:50.190
Gouta-kun.

09:50.190 --> 09:53.330
Sora-chan ran away from the hospital.

09:56.330 --> 09:57.320
Hey, you!

09:57.320 --> 09:58.700
What have you done to Sora?

09:58.700 --> 09:59.780
Gouta-kun.

10:06.370 --> 10:07.460
Gouta-kun.

10:07.460 --> 10:10.700
You... what have you done to her?!

10:11.470 --> 10:12.290
Gouta-kun!

10:13.290 --> 10:15.320
I saw it yesterday!

10:15.760 --> 10:17.360
You and Sora did...

10:20.360 --> 10:21.290
Fool!

10:22.680 --> 10:25.230
Sora-chan is dying.

10:32.690 --> 10:35.590
Sora is dying?

10:36.580 --> 10:38.280
Sora-chan has a disease.

10:40.180 --> 10:43.250
What do you mean by that?

10:44.550 --> 10:49.180
Your heart would beat faster from the shock you get when you suddenly raise your voice, right?

10:50.490 --> 10:54.180
Sora-chan's heartbeat won't return back to normal.

10:55.390 --> 10:57.660
What... no way!

10:58.080 --> 11:01.580
But she has been running around, laughing, being energetic...

11:02.320 --> 11:03.240
Gouta-kun.

11:04.900 --> 11:09.010
She's no different from normal people.

11:09.590 --> 11:12.020
However, if she hears a loud sound or is exposed to a strong light...

11:12.020 --> 11:14.520
And since there was thunder yesterday, Sora-chan...

11:14.520 --> 11:18.400
When you saw me trying to release her...

11:19.960 --> 11:21.610
all you could think of was something stupid.

11:24.840 --> 11:27.060
Will Sora be all right?

11:28.170 --> 11:30.640
But... to be dying...

11:31.900 --> 11:35.360
Sora-chan's father also passed away from the same disease.

11:36.540 --> 11:39.230
He died a year after his first convulsions.

11:40.460 --> 11:42.450
This is a special disease that only mages get.

11:43.790 --> 11:46.730
When did Sora have her first one?

11:47.930 --> 11:49.010
Summer of last year.

11:51.810 --> 11:52.680
Gouta-kun!

11:54.360 --> 11:56.400
Let's all look for Sora-chan together.

11:56.400 --> 11:57.250
Okay.

12:11.970 --> 12:12.870
Sora!

12:14.340 --> 12:15.270
Damn it!

12:16.210 --> 12:16.960
Sora.

12:58.790 --> 12:59.500
What the...?

13:19.140 --> 13:21.590
Sora... where are you?

13:22.920 --> 13:23.730
Damn it!

13:24.960 --> 13:25.660
I'm...

13:56.890 --> 13:57.890
Sora!

13:57.890 --> 13:58.810
Sora!

14:35.180 --> 14:36.850
You're here again?

14:36.850 --> 14:38.380
Hey you, tall guy.

14:39.590 --> 14:40.410
What?

14:40.960 --> 14:42.970
Didn't the two of you always walk together?

14:44.810 --> 14:45.650
You know...

14:45.650 --> 14:47.320
the girl with long hair.

14:47.320 --> 14:48.370
That's Sora.

14:50.290 --> 14:52.020
Have you seen Sora today?

14:52.760 --> 14:55.010
You're a bit scary.

14:55.850 --> 14:56.600
Sorry.

14:57.290 --> 14:59.640
I'm looking for her right now.

15:00.040 --> 15:04.080
She doesn't feel well, so I...

15:04.980 --> 15:05.840
I've seen her.

15:05.840 --> 15:06.760
When?

15:07.930 --> 15:09.440
Let me see...

15:10.360 --> 15:14.010
It was while I was preparing, so about forty minutes ago.

15:14.010 --> 15:16.450
Good, so Sora has returned to Shimokita.

15:17.040 --> 15:19.630
But just like me, she had no place to return to.

15:20.920 --> 15:22.270
Did you talk with her?

15:22.270 --> 15:23.480
Do you know where she went?

15:23.480 --> 15:25.590
No, I just saw her.

15:28.170 --> 15:29.160
Please.

15:29.740 --> 15:31.110
It was so sudden...

15:30.240 --> 15:32.590
Please let me use memory magic on you.

15:33.090 --> 15:34.010
Magic?

15:36.360 --> 15:38.900
I'm a mage.

15:40.550 --> 15:41.260
Sure.

15:42.790 --> 15:44.970
Magic sounds interesting anyway.

15:46.440 --> 15:47.370
Thank you.

15:49.190 --> 15:50.070
Okay.

15:51.960 --> 15:53.630
All right, go ahead.

15:57.410 --> 16:01.480
Let the memory inside of you be shown here and now.

16:03.500 --> 16:04.260
Sora!

16:18.180 --> 16:19.330
She went towards Kitazawa!

16:19.330 --> 16:20.180
Thank you!

16:23.200 --> 16:25.120
Your magic is amazing!

16:25.120 --> 16:27.760
Good luck, tall guy!

16:35.270 --> 16:36.940
Gave me a shock.

16:38.130 --> 16:39.240
Magic, huh?

18:19.920 --> 18:22.790
You can't use magic for yourself.

18:24.080 --> 18:25.500
It's not for me.

18:26.510 --> 18:27.580
It was for you.

18:28.950 --> 18:32.250
You can't become a mage if you do this.

18:32.250 --> 18:33.270
I don't care.

18:36.830 --> 18:37.820
I...

18:38.970 --> 18:41.410
always did things halfway, whether it was magic or something else.

18:46.340 --> 18:49.230
They said that you're dying.

18:51.460 --> 18:54.690
I see, you know already.

19:05.650 --> 19:09.850
You know, I woke someone who was unconscious.

19:10.540 --> 19:11.240
Yeah.

19:12.010 --> 19:15.720
But that person had lost all of their memories.

19:16.530 --> 19:17.320
I see.

19:18.360 --> 19:22.660
If I died, I would not be remembered by anyone.

19:23.830 --> 19:26.920
It's as if I am disappearing.

19:28.250 --> 19:31.370
Although I asked them to let me use magic again,

19:32.220 --> 19:33.520
they refused.

19:44.530 --> 19:47.260
Why are you so calm?

19:48.420 --> 19:49.260
Huh?

19:51.750 --> 19:54.580
You actually hate magic, am I right?

19:54.580 --> 19:55.640
Why?

19:56.780 --> 19:59.380
You hate magic the most.

19:59.380 --> 20:00.330
No.

20:01.770 --> 20:04.630
In reality, you want to cry, more than anyone.

20:04.630 --> 20:05.690
Stop it!

20:08.970 --> 20:12.050
My mind is already prepared for this.

20:16.690 --> 20:17.480
That's a lie!

20:19.920 --> 20:22.510
How can you know what my feelings are?

20:25.200 --> 20:26.480
That's because I want to know...

20:27.970 --> 20:28.990
even just a little bit...

20:28.990 --> 20:30.200
your feelings...

20:31.600 --> 20:32.380
So...

20:32.740 --> 20:33.580
I...

20:33.580 --> 20:35.540
You hate magic!

20:35.540 --> 20:36.610
Shut up!

20:37.090 --> 20:38.540
You want to cry, more than anybody.

20:38.540 --> 20:39.290
Shut up!

20:39.420 --> 20:40.090
Shut up!

20:40.380 --> 20:40.960
Shut up!

20:41.050 --> 20:41.590
Shut up!

20:41.800 --> 20:42.420
Shut up!

20:42.630 --> 20:43.170
Shut up!

20:43.590 --> 20:44.380
Shut up!

20:44.590 --> 20:45.260
Shut up!

20:46.760 --> 20:47.740
Shut up...

20:54.950 --> 20:57.440
I'm glad that I found you safe and sound.

21:00.990 --> 21:02.190
You're still living.

21:03.430 --> 21:05.950
I'm really glad...

21:08.680 --> 21:10.550
Why does it have to be me?

21:13.340 --> 21:14.590
Say, Gouta,

21:15.370 --> 21:18.030
I want to continue living.

21:19.790 --> 21:21.310
Why does it have to be me?

21:22.480 --> 21:23.570
I'm terribly scared.

21:24.050 --> 21:27.420
I want to continue living.

21:27.790 --> 21:29.320
I don't want to die.

21:29.920 --> 21:30.760
Gouta...

21:31.810 --> 21:32.670
Gouta...

23:06.400 --> 23:07.520
Hara-sensei.

23:07.950 --> 23:12.860
This summer, I was able to come to Tokyo and meet everyone.

23:12.860 --> 23:14.510
I was really happy about it!

23:15.230 --> 23:16.880
Next episode: Graduation.

23:17.300 --> 23:19.560
It'd be nice if everyone could graduate together!
